                        "$\\frac{h - (-1)}{3} = \\frac{k - 3}{-4} = -\\frac{3(-1) - 4(3) - 16}{3^2 + (-4)^2} = -\\frac{-3 - 12 - 16}{25} = -\\frac{-31}{25} = \\frac{31}{25}$.",
