                        "Slope of $3x - 4y + 7 = 0$ is $m_2 = \\frac{3}{4}$.",
                        "Lines are perpendicular $\\iff m_1 m_2 = -1$.",
                        "$\\left(-\\frac{2}{k}\\right)\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right) = -1 \\implies -\\frac{6}{4k} = -1 \\implies 4k = 6 \\implies k = \\frac{3}{2}$."
                    ],
                    "finalAnswer": "$k = \\frac{3}{2}$"
