                        "Then $y_1 = 5\\left(\\frac{26}{23}\\right) + 4 = \\frac{222}{23}$.",
                        "Slope $m = \\frac{222/23 - 5}{26/23 - 1} = \\frac{107/23}{3/23} = \\frac{107}{3}$.",
                        "Equation through $(1, 5)$ with slope $\\frac{107}{3}$: $y - 5 = \\frac{107}{3}(x - 1) \\implies 107x - 3y - 92 = 0$."
